# Monetization Rules

## Authority

Server EntitlementService is SoR. Clients display only.

## Payments

- Provider adapters only
- Verify webhooks/signatures
- Idempotent fulfill
- PaymentPolicyConfig for store rules — do not hard-code forever

## Rewards

- Eligibility server-side
- SSV verify before grant
- Quotas/cooldowns
- Never grant from client boolean alone

## Bundles

Purchase grants bundle + child entitlements atomically (or outbox-equivalent)
